Hi,

> does anyone know of any BT 2.0 CF cards that have been released that
> work with bluez/2.6 kernel?

the current Bluetooth version is 1.2 and as far as I know there are no
Bluetooth 1.2 CF cards on the market, but you can check the cards from
Brainboxes and see if they provide an update. In general every CSR
BlueCore02 based CF or PCMCIA card with 8 Mbit flash can be updated to
the Bluetooth 1.2 standard.

Regards

Marcel




